## 🛠️ Installation Instructions

### 🍎 For macOS Users
1. Download [**`Interview-Buddy.dmg`**](https://github.com/ganesh-code/InterviewBuddy-Releases/releases/latest/download/Interview-Buddy.dmg).
2. Double-click the `.dmg` file and drag **Interview Buddy** into your **Applications** folder.
3. Open the app from your Applications folder.

#### ⚠️ macOS Security Notice (Gatekeeper)
If macOS displays **"Interview Buddy cannot be opened because it is from an unidentified developer"** or **"App is damaged"**:
1. Open **System Settings** → **Privacy & Security**.
2. Scroll down to the **Security** section.
3. Click **"Open Anyway"** next to *Interview Buddy*.
4. *Alternative*: Right-click (or Control-click) `Interview Buddy.app` in Applications and select **Open**, then click **Open** in the confirmation prompt.

---

### 🪟 For Windows Users
1. Download [**`Interview-Buddy-Setup.exe`**](https://github.com/ganesh-code/InterviewBuddy-Releases/releases/latest/download/Interview-Buddy-Setup.exe).
2. Run the installer. It will install the application and create desktop and start menu shortcuts.

#### ⚠️ Windows Defender SmartScreen Notice
If Windows SmartScreen shows **"Windows protected your PC"**:
1. Click **"More info"**.
2. Click **"Run anyway"**.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 🎧 **System Loopback Audio Capture**: Real-time interviewer speech transcription without requiring virtual cables or extensions.
- ⚡ **Sub-Second Streaming Answers**: Powered by Claude 3.5 Sonnet, GPT-4o, and Gemini 2.0 Flash for instant answer recommendations.
- 🫥 **Screen-Share Invisible Overlay**: Built with native OS window flags so the overlay is completely invisible to screen shares (Zoom, Meet, Teams).
- 🎙️ **Push-to-Talk (PTT)**: Optional quick hotkey mode to capture specific interviewer questions on command.
- 🧪 **Built-in Pre-Flight Audio Simulator**: Test microphone, loopback audio, and AI response flow before joining your real interview.
- 🎁 **Referral Rewards Program**: Invite peers and earn free pro session passes automatically.

---

## 🔒 Privacy & Security

- **Zero Audio Storage**: Audio streams are processed strictly in-memory for transcription and are immediately discarded.
- **No Keystroke Tracking**: Hotkeys only listen for the user-configured shortcut.
- **End-to-End Encryption**: All API communications use TLS 1.3 encryption.

